<newsitem itemid="172493" id="root" date="1996-11-07" xml:lang="en">
<title>HUNGARY: Graboplast reports Jan-Sept profit surge.</title>
<headline>Graboplast reports Jan-Sept profit surge.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-Sept 1996   Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	  1,124.8    vs    485.4</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	    1,050.6    vs    359.3</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	    868.0    vs    359.3</p>
<p>    Group net sales		  11,482.1    vs  5,771.1</p>
<p>	Net domestic sales	    4,727.2    vs  2,291.9</p>
<p>	Net export sales		6,754.9    vs  3,479.2</p>
<p>    Group other revenue		 196.5    vs    152.1 @</p>
<p>    Group direct costs of sales   6,900.2    vs  3,945.0</p>
<p>    Group indirect costs of sales 3,247.5    vs  1,229.3</p>
<p>    Group other expenditures	  406.2    vs    263.5</p>
<p>    Group net financial income	148.6 loss vs  114.7 loss</p>
<p>    Group financial revenue	   401.9    vs     39.8</p>
<p>    Group financial expenditure     550.5    vs    154.5</p>
<p>    Group net extraord. income	 74.4 profit vs 11.3 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	 1,873.7    vs     24.8</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure   1,799.4    vs     36.1</p>
<p>    Group taxation			185.2    vs	0. @</p>
<p>NOTE - Graboplast Rt is a home improvement product manufacturer group.</p>
<p>The company said the figures were calculated according to Hungarian Accounting Standards. The figures are consolidated.</p>
<p>The group's structure was different in the corresponding 1995 period because since then Graboplast has acquired Keszta-Dunawall Kft wall-paper company.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
